   "text": "Constraints: CHECK (targetType='Manager') = (tenantId IS NULL)  |  unique (tenantId, lower(accessKey)) alive\none active password per person; many key-based allowed  |  enums: common_status = active|suspended,\ncredential_types = password|key-based|totp(deferred)  |  today only the old users table exists (create-user migration)",
   "originalText": "Constraints: CHECK (targetType='Manager') = (tenantId IS NULL)  |  unique (tenantId, lower(accessKey)) alive\none active password per person; many key-based allowed  |  enums: common_status = active|suspended,\ncredential_types = password|key-based|totp(deferred)  |  today only the old users table exists (create-user migration)",
